  "definition": "Operating Hours: Limit, Consequences of Exceeding Limit",
  "effectiveDate": "2018-08-15",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-A 1300) #9803, eff 10-31-10; ss by #12584, eff 8-15-18",
